     A**
     A** EDI/NOI A49 Transmission File - TDP Segment
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A**
     A          R PTD01                     TEXT('EDI A49 Format - TDP')
     A            TDCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            TDEXDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('EXTRACT DATE')
     A*
     A***    Transaction
     A*
     A            TDTSET    R    3A         REFFLD(CODE)
     A                                      TEXT('TRANSACTION SET ID')
     A            TDMTC     R               REFFLD(CODE)
     A                                      TEXT('MAINT TYPE CODE')
     A            TDTDT     R    8S 0       REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      TEXT('MAINT TYPE CODE DATE')
     A*
     A***    Jurisdiction
     A*
     A            TDJRST    R               REFFLD(CODE)
     A                                      TEXT('JURISDICTION')
     A*
     A*  ACCIDENT
     A*
     A            TDACLC    R   25A         REFFLD(DS20)
     A                                      COLHDG('ADMIN' 'CLAIM' '#')
     A*
     A*  PERMANENT IMPAIRMENT OCCURS UP TO 26 TIMES
     A*
     A            TDRRCD         3          TEXT('REDUCED EARN REC CODE')
     A                                      COLHDG('REDUCED EARN REC CD')
     A            TDRRAM         9  2       TEXT('REDUCED EARN REC AMT')
     A                                      COLHDG('REDUCED EARN REC AMT')
     A*
     A            TDSTAT    R               REFFLD(STAT)
     A            TDUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A            TDPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A            TDTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A            TDDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE' 'MAINTAINED')
